ner noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cac.gov.cn/2025-03/21/c_1744174262156096.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cac.gov.cn/2025-03/21/c_1744174262156096.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["最常遇到的是小区门禁、租房平台、健身房、酒店要你录人脸。对方说「系统只支持刷脸」的时候，把办法的原话念给他听。原话是：「实现相同目的或者达到同等业务要求，存在其他非人脸识别技术方式的，不得将人脸识别技术作为唯一验证方式」。然后要求它提供刷卡、密码或者身份证这类别的方式。还是不给的，向当地网信部门反映。国家对刷脸验证身份另有规定的，比如一部分金融和政务场景，按那些规定办。人脸和密码最大的区别是泄露之后改不掉，所以它值得比密码更谨慎。存了 10 万人以上人脸信息的单位，要在 30 个工作日内向省级以上网信部门备案，这也是判断对方正不正规的一个问法。查阅、更正、删除自己个人信息的权利见第 8 条。别人借你的脸去办他自己的贷款，是另一回事，见第 8 节第 45 条（帮忙刷个脸）。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/14-08"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"你有权查看、复制、更正和删除自己的个人信息，被拒绝可以起诉"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/14-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"别把代码、密钥和隐私资料交给来路不明的「AI 中转站」，让 AI 自动执行命令时尤其如此"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/14-02"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["邮箱密码单独一个，不和任何网站重复"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["别的网站被偷走的密码，会被人拿来直接登你的邮箱。邮箱一旦被人登进去，凡是能用邮箱找回密码的账号，都跟着一起丢。所以邮箱的密码要单独一个，别…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/14-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["手机设锁屏密码，SIM 卡设 PIN 码"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["SIM 卡就是手机里那张小卡片，短信验证码靠它来收。手机丢了，捡到的人会把这张卡拔下来，插进别的手机收验证码，再挨个重置你的账号。给卡设一…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/14-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["手机丢了按这个顺序做：挂失 SIM 卡、远程锁定、改密码、报警、冻结银行卡"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["顺序比手快更重要。第一步挂失 SIM 卡，验证码这条命脉就断了。接着远程锁住手机，再用电脑改邮箱和支付密码，然后报警拿回执，最后看情况冻结…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/14-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["卡被盗刷先挂失冻结再报警，然后要求银行赔：证明「是你自己刷的」是银行的责任"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["卡被人盗刷，不用你去证明「这不是我刷的」。反过来，是银行要拿出证据证明这笔是你本人刷的，拿不出就得赔你。前提是你一发现就挂失冻结。拖着不挂…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/14-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["每隔一段时间看一次账号的登录设备和已授权应用，不用的清掉"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["「登录设备」是指现在还能用你账号的那些手机和电脑。列表里冒出你不认识的设备，或者早就不用的软件还连着你的账号，就先改密码，再退出全部登录。…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/14-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["别为了用 App 点「全部同意」：不是必需的信息，你不同意也不能拒绝给你服务"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["App 要你的信息，如果不是提供这项服务必须用的，你不同意给，它不能因此不让你用。它能收的，也只限于用得着的那些。地图要你的位置是必须的，…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/14"},"children":["阅读整个主题：账号与信息安全"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored","data-ad-placement":"ad_footer","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"广告 · 社区推荐"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"生财有术官方 Logo","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-label"},"children":["广告 · 社区推荐"]},{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["读过的知识，能不能做成有用的产品？"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["从电子书、资料到小工具，看看圈友怎样发现需求，把内容变成实际交付。"]}]},{"tag":